OL,3,GNEWSAAirport customers hit by payment  
OL,4,Adata breach                            
OL,6,FA data breach affecting a third-party  
OL,7,Fpayment system used for Gatwick Airport
OL,8,Fdrop-off charges is being investigated,
OL,9,Fthe airport has confirmed.             
OL,11,FThe incident has resulted in the       
OL,12,Fpersonal data of some customers being  
OL,13,Faccessed, a spokesman for the airport  
OL,14,Fin West Sussex said.                   
OL,16,FThey said the data included login      
OL,17,Fcredentials, email and home addresses, 
OL,18,Fdetails of cars registered on the      
OL,19,Fsystem and in some cases payment card  
OL,20,Finformation.                           
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
