OL,3,GNEWSAAirport customers hit by payment  
OL,4,Adata breach                            
OL,6,F"Our investigation is ongoing. We have 
OL,7,Fidentified that the incident impacts   
OL,8,Fsome customer information and those who
OL,9,Fhave been affected have been informed,"
OL,10,Fthey said. They added the Information  
OL,11,FCommissioner's Office has been         
OL,12,Finformed.                              
